        <mxCell id="jknl4GV_5Kp7UUgPtqsj-28" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consistent Additional Terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§216&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Evidence of a consistent additional term is admissible to supplement an integrated agreement &lt;b&gt;unless&lt;/b&gt; the court finds that the agreement was &lt;b&gt;completely integrated&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) An agreement is &lt;b&gt;not completely integrated&lt;/b&gt; if the writing omits a consistent additional term&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(a) &lt;/span&gt;agreed to for separate consideration, or&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(b) &lt;/span&gt;such a term as in the circumstances might naturally be omitted from the writing. (still must consider circumstances&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="330" x="-2260" y="2790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jknl4GV_5Kp7UUgPtqsj-33" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merger clause&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;i style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;indicates that a writing is completely integrated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&quot;there are no other agreements&quot; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
