        <mxCell id="G36qB-AvQh-2CrSp8RL_-13" parent="HMSoyMslVgJfamAm2t2m-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Example:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Heater Basement Case&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;if a consumer brings schematics and asks for a recommendation from a merchant then the merchant warrants the good is fit for the &lt;u&gt;specific purpose&lt;/u&gt; even if good is fit for ordinary purpose (merchantability)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="270" x="-2660" y="275" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
