        <mxCell id="6B3nPEzSoxyGV4064Geq-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Acceptance&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- The continued power to complete the mutual assent unless offer has been terminated&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;by silence: &lt;/i&gt;(1)&amp;nbsp;offeree takes benefit (2)&amp;nbsp;stated (3)&amp;nbsp;previous dealings or knowledge&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="245" x="1190" y="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HVkuDwZSJNjPWWiSZ_Nl-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Termination:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;An offer may be terminated before acceptance from any; Rejection, lapse, revocation, death or incapacity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counter&amp;nbsp;offer:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a rejection&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(204, 204, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indirect Revocation:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(87, 87, 0);&quot;&gt;if by a reliable source&lt;i&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(87, 87, 0); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(87, 87, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mail box rule:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(173, 173, 98);&quot;&gt;Acceptances are effective upon dispatch, unless&amp;nbsp;a rejection has already been sent, waive right to effective dispatch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(173, 173, 98); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(173, 173, 98);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;caret-color: light-dark(rgb(173, 173, 98), rgb(97, 97, 32));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(97, 97, 32); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Option Contract:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(162, 162, 106);&quot;&gt;(1) Offerer expects action or forbearance before acceptance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(162, 162, 106);&quot;&gt;(2) and which does induce such action or forbearance is binding as an option contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="360" x="1190" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consideration:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- To consititute consideration a performance, or return promise must be bargained for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;Bargained for exchange&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;Illusory Promise&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Forbearance, Act,&amp;nbsp;Creation or modification of legal doc&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Promise&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: can be consideration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="300" x="1640" y="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-18" edge="1" parent="1" source="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-7" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-17" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Promissory Estoppel:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) A promise which the promisor reasonably expects to induce action or forbearance,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) and does induce such action or forbearance, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) injustice can only be avoided via enforcement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Used to&amp;nbsp;enforces a promise to prevent injustice&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Reliance damages only&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="350" x="670" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Certainty&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;/definiteness:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§33&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Even if there is offer, acceptance, consideration and the proper mutual assent, terms must be certain for a contract to be binding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="240" x="760" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-17" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Quasi- Contract&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Plaintiff conferred a benefit on the defendant&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) Appreciation by defendant for that benefit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) Acceptance and retention of that benefit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Used for making a party pay for&amp;nbsp;a benefit received&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="350" x="1100" y="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
