          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-72" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Statute of Frauds&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Performance over a year&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;either party can&#39;t perform in less than a year (narrowly construed, any chance within a year kills it)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lease and sale or real property&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;YEAR and a Day, not just a year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(Does not need SOF if made payments, taken possession, ect.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;Goods $500 or more&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: (500 works) (unless&amp;nbsp;Goods are not suitable for sale elsewhere) (merchants -&amp;nbsp;10 day rule for Read Your mail )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="380" x="6800" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-73" edge="1" parent="1" source="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-74" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-75" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-74" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Writing &amp;amp; Sign Requirements:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Essential Terms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Signed by D (2-201, unless objected in 10 days then considered signed)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;ALSO for $500: Need Quantity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Also:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Need not be formal&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Can be before or after&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- only quantity of goods shown in the writing&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="250" x="7070" y="-200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-75" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Other Reasons to enforce&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Promissory Estoppel&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;A promise which the promisor reasonably expects to induce action or forbearance, and does induce such action or forbearance, and injustice can only be avoided via informant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Equitable Estoppel&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: Misrepresentation or concealment of material facts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Unfairness if party is allowed to assert the truth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="310" x="7270" y="-450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-76" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Capacity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 13 - Guardianship (Void)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 14 - Infants (voidable) (Douglass v. Pflueger Hawaii)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 15 - Mental Illness (voidable)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="260" x="7520" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-77" edge="1" parent="1" source="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-78" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-79" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-78" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Mistake:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mutual&lt;/b&gt; :&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- Basic Assumption by both&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Material Effect&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- §154 does not apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Unilateral Also needs:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;/span&gt;Enforcement would be unconscionable (unfair)&lt;br&gt;or&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- The other party knew or caused&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;UNLESS §154&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Party Bears risk of Mistake&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;a) Risk is allocated by agreement&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;b) Went into it knowing they didn&#39;t know&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;c) Court says it is reasonable - judgment errors does not count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="465" x="7870" y="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-79" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Misrepresentation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Unconscionable&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Misrepresentation&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- half truth is misrepresentation&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- basic non-disclosure does not typically create liability &lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- deliberate concealment = misrepresentation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unconscionable&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- procedural vs substantive &lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- hardship&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- mistaken Bargain of the other party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="330" x="8310" y="-200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-80" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Illegality:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- illegal contracts are void&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- no remedies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;if use is improper&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Enforcement is not precluded on public policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot; style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Unless:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot; style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- acted to further improper use&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot; style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Knew of improper use &amp;amp; grave social harm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(Note repeated sales)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="300" x="7690" y="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FVZ4G-h6ewI_RDV9Xo5a-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-83" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-84">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FVZ4G-h6ewI_RDV9Xo5a-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-83" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-85">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-83" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;Parole Evidence rule:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Prevents parties from introducing extrinsic evidence, such as prior oral or written agreements, to change or contradict the terms of a final, written contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;First :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;is it &lt;b&gt;integrated:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;final and complete expression of the parties&#39; deal (from this step forward can&#39;t clash with original agreement)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Second: &lt;b&gt;complete or incomplete&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Complete-  &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;then&amp;nbsp;discharges prior agreements all together&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;Incomplete - can be supplemented with consistent additional terms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;*&lt;b&gt;not completely integrated&lt;/b&gt; if the writing omits a consistent additional term &lt;br/&gt;&#x9;(a) agreed to for separate consideration, or&lt;br/&gt;&#x9;(b) such a term as in the circumstances might naturally be omitted from the writing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="490" x="12280" y="-55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-84" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merger clause&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;i style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;indicates that a writing is completely integrated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&quot;there are no other agreements&quot; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="210" x="12150" y="-390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-85" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collateral Agreement&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Mitchill v. Lath,&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Be collateral in form;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) &amp;nbsp;Not contradict terms of the written contract&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) Be one that the parties would not ordinarily be expected to include in the writing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Case&lt;/b&gt;: Icehouse removal before land buying, did not pass because would normally have been included.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="260" x="12480" y="-450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-95" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;Derivative title:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A purchaser of goods acquires all title that his transferor had&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;Except&lt;/b&gt;: Voidable Title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- Caused by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: medium; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;/span&gt;given through fraudulent action &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- merchant who deals in a good of that kind &#x9;&#x9;(entrustment) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the seller was tricked about the buyer’s identity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the buyer paid with a check that later bounced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the parties said it was “cash sale”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the buyer used fraud that could be criminal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Thus can be&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;can be sold&lt;/b&gt; if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(1)  Good faith purchaser &lt;br/&gt;(1.2) pays value&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="430" x="11560" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7JR-Kf3DFgIWmuQxfMb8-104" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Limited Remedies&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;UCC § 2-719&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(1) A contract can provide for remedies in addition to or in substitution for those that Article 2 provides&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Disclaim A2 remedies by saying &#39;exclusive&#39; &lt;/b&gt;- prob not super tight&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) If exclusive or limited remedy&lt;b&gt; &quot;fails&amp;nbsp;essential purpose&quot;&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;Then fill the gaps with A2&amp;nbsp;because a contract must have a &quot;&lt;b&gt;minimum&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt; adequate remedy&lt;/b&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(3)  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;A contract can limit or exclud&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;e:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;commercial losses But NOT personal injury&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="400" x="13530" y="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
